      "code": "let a = String::from(\"hi\");\nlet b = a;                 // ⚠ **移动**：a 之后不能再用\n// println!(\"{}\", a);      // —— ⚠ 编译错误：value borrowed here after move\nprintln!(\"{}\", b);\n\nlet n = 1;\nlet m = n;                 // Copy 类型是复制，n 仍然可用\nprintln!(\"{}\", n);\n\nlet s = String::from(\"hi\");\nlet r = &s;                // 借用：不转移所有权\nprintln!(\"{} {}\", s, r);   // 两者都能用\n\nlet c = s.clone();         // 想要独立副本就显式 clone（有开销）",
